{"title":"1959 IMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For what real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/9/9b9e896602549219be7533cc77ad9fbbd3b41c75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt{2x-1}} + \\sqrt{x-\\sqrt{2x-1}} = A,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"296\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>given (a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/6989f1e74b2b01b8f76898afbe686c37e0a7b081.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />, (b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/8/f18428217dcd07944b2adbebcafd0978587a770a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, (c) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f1a0a1fba5abcc1686547b4c9754aa25665358a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=2$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, where only non-negative real numbers are admitted for square roots?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that the equation can be rewritten to \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/884369b218153470eb5c493a1c1ab3777ba3d6b5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{2x-1}+1)^2} + \\sqrt{(\\sqrt{2x-1}-1)^2}=A\\sqrt{2}\\]\" width=\"356\" height=\"32\" />\ni.e., <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/d/cadad851b81aeeb0cd3c331f6ec6ba087908b28b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{2x-1}+1 + |\\sqrt{2x-1}-1|=A\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"291\" height=\"24\" />. \n</p><p><b>Case I:</b> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/b/41b78b91a72babf014f1903958ca5c100953f165.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x-1\\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" /> (i.e., <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd70eb3335de97b1d0b61733183aba667317380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />), the equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/5/385375dd4fe90a29719fa3755c38448790bb0801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{2x-1}=\\sqrt{2}A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"139\" height=\"22\" />. For (a), we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />; for (b) we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/d/ddd0e4dee509171009ae4c33230fbf87827b4358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />; for (c) we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/6/b469dcc2e054456ab4c6d9a8c8b5403a61178241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd70eb3335de97b1d0b61733183aba667317380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />, (b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/d/ddd0e4dee509171009ae4c33230fbf87827b4358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" /> is not what we want.\n</p><p><b>Case II:</b> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/8/7b8406abb87a4d5b74f2d87b0a46e4ad75b17bfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le 2x-1 &lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"119\" height=\"16\" /> (i.e., <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/3/ed3c970e1cd261e50b4b0d50031c2384392318da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/2\\le x &lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" />), the equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/0/0f03588158adb1017219f4ede1c8795ef2592f9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2=\\sqrt{2}A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"21\" />, which only works for (a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/6989f1e74b2b01b8f76898afbe686c37e0a7b081.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>In summary, any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/8/52821195ec78f3d797cd79d247341eff469ef0bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in \\left[\\frac{1}{2}, 1\\right]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"83\" height=\"45\" /> is a solution for (a); there is no solution for (b); there is one solution for (c), which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/6/b469dcc2e054456ab4c6d9a8c8b5403a61178241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />,  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/8/c78b1c6b1d0fc9ded8d819c480a03a084165b113.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ge \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />. Also,\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/f/26ffe6856026f0e5351ffd91ee49f5f29ba6a630.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt{2x-1}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} |\\sqrt{2x-1}+1|\\]\" width=\"272\" height=\"42\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/a/dfab3027f8039fb5b1018ab0490b15ee72d787b8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} (\\sqrt{2x-1}+1),\\]\" width=\"161\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27ce8556df3092b6abe096cda51519b7c544c89.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{x-\\sqrt{2x-1}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} |\\sqrt{2x-1}-1|\\]\" width=\"272\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>It is easy to know:\n</p><p>(1) When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/8/52821195ec78f3d797cd79d247341eff469ef0bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in \\left[\\frac{1}{2}, 1\\right]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"83\" height=\"45\" />,\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/1/9e139a39e854577bbe51d23c93c2476383a0672f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|\\sqrt{2x-1}-1| = 1-\\sqrt{2x-1}.\\]\" width=\"230\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>(2) When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/f/75ffecad4aa936de6140aed54c5af620b667dcf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ge 1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e0f8060dff67cb5081dcb56a432a34fbfc5454.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|\\sqrt{2x-1}-1| = \\sqrt{2x-1}-1.\\]\" width=\"230\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>Let's define\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/3/5e30493248c69384a9c0001ed2984cb1c2029f0a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A = \\sqrt{x+\\sqrt{2x-1}} + \\sqrt{x-\\sqrt{2x-1}} =\\]\" width=\"311\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/b/17be3f65a2e204524ad3ccfb602f0bba3f79fe82.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} (\\sqrt{2x-1}+1+|\\sqrt{2x-1}-1|).\\]\" width=\"291\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>Hence, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/8/52821195ec78f3d797cd79d247341eff469ef0bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in \\left[\\frac{1}{2}, 1\\right]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"83\" height=\"45\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/1/2d140fcc53ebfc5acb1bd28e3d7cc123a4af67e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\sqrt{2};$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"23\" />  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/f/75ffecad4aa936de6140aed54c5af620b667dcf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ge 1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/f/b2f1543ca7dae0c4f7eb2a7ae53df5d50a33fe71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A \\ge \\sqrt{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"22\" /> \n</p><p>To sum up, the solution for (a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/8/52821195ec78f3d797cd79d247341eff469ef0bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in \\left[\\frac{1}{2}, 1\\right]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"83\" height=\"45\" />; (b) No solution; (c)  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/6/b469dcc2e054456ab4c6d9a8c8b5403a61178241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />. \n</p><p>~EUCLID_2003\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We first Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/3/bc36628e23bf6ca4008b80f5629c63b046f9f4e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M = \\sqrt{x+\\sqrt{2x-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"162\" height=\"34\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/0/ef01df8793ab2a7a7364a54f03da652a5c3913ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = \\sqrt{x-\\sqrt{2x-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"159\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>As given by the question, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/a/a7a7546ef83fe86bee66def40693d44f697ab867.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M + N = A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Then, the square root expression in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> motivates us to square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/9/829846a9a6071f20f45919f18dfd7cb0c30118ca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[M^2 = x+\\sqrt{2x-1}\\]\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/a/94a478dd9a920ba54dc5dff0c2e19ec2de497628.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N^2 = x-\\sqrt{2x-1}\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Manipulating with the algebraic properties, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/1/84131e26fc92e1c5504811a8c244363a060a9b39.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[M^2-N^2=2\\sqrt{2x-1}\\]\" width=\"172\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/1/691e5aba3dcf73e701cb983dd48b501d190be4f0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[M^2+N^2=2x\\]\" width=\"116\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/2/7b2409570ee4da784cd3375b4d2816dffef6d870.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[M \\times N = |x-1|\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Now, we have 3 variables, and 4 equations, and the question is almost solved:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/7/d1751607c64eec6351e3814295b17c18e7a36baa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{cases} M + N = A \\\\ M^2-N^2=2\\sqrt{2x-1} \\\\ M^2+N^2=2x\\\\ M \\times N = |x-1| \\end{cases}\\]\" width=\"185\" height=\"96\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/a/f9ac1f3c231ab3e357a5c3e685e531954279ae63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M^2-N^2 = (M+N) \\times (M-N)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"267\" height=\"21\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/b/74b1b8195451b9e96daf352b051cd2aeca3db453.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M-N = \\frac{M^2-N^2}{M+N} = \\frac{2\\sqrt{2x-1}}{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"265\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1ef55dfc7478735819a6e542e20a007c4a8e0e5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(M+N)^2+(M-N)^2 = 2(M^2+N^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"305\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/7/a378484cfb3b0b43dcd5ad2e1d0b74b03690aeed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A^2 + (\\frac{2\\sqrt{2x-1}}{A})^2 = 2 \\times 2x \\Rightarrow A^2+\\frac{8x-4}{A^2} = 4x\\]\" width=\"388\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Also, we have certain restrictions on the range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p>1. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad2268466caa848833eb91d83c3b07522bc8ada0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{2x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"68\" height=\"21\" /> is defined: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/a/d0a9c861364407510b92c03dd39f8bbfcbea1f11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x-1 \\geq 0 \\Rightarrow x \\geq \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"162\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>2. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a7d9c15d03dd818f7b923fc0ef698d9c132ae99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x-\\sqrt{2x-1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"118\" height=\"34\" /> is defined: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/7/7f79329d0850fbdb6bfa7ca4924f4d419d462797.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-\\sqrt{2x-1} \\geq 0 \\Rightarrow x \\geq \\sqrt{2x-1} \\Rightarrow x^2 \\geq 2x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"384\" height=\"21\" />(This part does not give any restriction as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/5/8e5fb0d703ed8935f330f7642e9de8d566a751f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-2x+1 = (x-1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"180\" height=\"21\" /> is always greater than or equal to 0.\n</p><p>3. By using RMS-AM inequality on the original equation, we have: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/3268fb40025eee02ab61c21f54a6509e957cbd56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x} \\geq (\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt{2x-1}} + \\sqrt{x-\\sqrt{2x-1}})/2 = A/2 \\Rightarrow x \\geq A^2/4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"497\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>4. By using AM-GM inequality on the original equation, we have: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/e/72e4138646f79704666bf6a7a2ce67a42b5044ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt(|x-1|) \\leq A/2 \\Rightarrow |x-1| \\leq A^2/4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"285\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>Now, we can solve for x, given three values of A:\n</p><p>1. When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/3/3b3c7ced97dfcb97ddfae38854cc502d1caf0440.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/b/ecb981d6c078f46e7db0e7ad76aef69337979aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+\\frac{8x-4}{2} = 4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"38\" />, it seems that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can be any value, but we need to verify with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f7330c58f62b7ecdf565b4d78e412e1a274b6390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\times N = |x-1|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" />, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/2/f92ef6a832a08d4132c3f5cab4f12d5c3fca1da2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\times N = \\frac{(M+N)^2-(M^2+N^2)}{2} = \\frac{2-2x}{2} \\Rightarrow \\frac{2-2x}{2} = |x-1| \\Rightarrow 1-x=|x-1|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"662\" height=\"41\" />, meaning that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/a/b9afbaa16cfe6f80af3e0aad0641fcbe60dcae2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />, from the restrictions, we also have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/9647e8cc23700d4ba16f18bbf8b4623c4448c939.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/c/c4c0bca9ca1771f608c077c3aa337183a90070cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in \\left[1/2, 3/2 \\right]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>2. When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da3d600d21b2b1343040ecb85db0e354a60e96a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/a/57a6120ae503174f2734270858d83eb07b1bba1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+\\frac{8x-4}{1} = 4x \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"208\" height=\"38\" />, still, testing with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f7330c58f62b7ecdf565b4d78e412e1a274b6390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\times N = |x-1|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/d/42d5a88735cf520d762e0aa11c1f8f9fef757f46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1-2x}{2} = |x-1|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"38\" />, there is no solution.\n</p><p>3. When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c13d77e2b5ede10a622c2229043191de82ce17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 2$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/2/ba216200a71a67b136596b779f16e3d760ee7307.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+\\frac{8x-4}{4} = 4x \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"208\" height=\"38\" />, verifying with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f7330c58f62b7ecdf565b4d78e412e1a274b6390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\times N = |x-1|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e95475ec029fe8b51ba2b3347eaf801f3341e46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4-2x}{2} = |x-1|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"38\" />, we can see that indeed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/3/003bcebc12d2d3dd5107627be5b8f237dff6c147.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" /> is a solution.\n</p><p>Therefore, our answer is: \n</p><p>\\begin{cases}\nA = \\sqrt{2}, x \\in \\left[1/2, 1 \\right]\\\\\nA = 1, \\text{No solution}\\\\\nA = 2, x = \\frac{3}{2}\n\\end{cases}\n</p><p>Comments: the question is elegant in its algebraic properties, in fact, there are so many ways to utilize the properties of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecf6f7d41b2ef0706808cd82f82982337579310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M^2+N^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/d/5dd5a8bc23a54d7ef6deb0c1db3523c1ead488ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M+N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/b/92bd6eec3f70ae51cdf33254fc8da26e69a4bc14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M-N$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/2/9c23101d7d574e2c100aab6e32175004d2d9c425.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M^2-N^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/7/c974ce563a0da50b16b3b28b389de6ccd4aceb8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\times N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" />. This is an especially weird problem, there are 3 variables and 4 equations; when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/3/3b3c7ced97dfcb97ddfae38854cc502d1caf0440.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />, x seems to take any value, surely the core equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f7330c58f62b7ecdf565b4d78e412e1a274b6390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\times N = |x-1|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" />, but why not the other 3? Can you solve the problem using the other 3 equations along? Those are some of the questions to consider. For the restrictions, surely some of the restrictions are inherent. My method seemed chaotic, but is probably what contestants with some experience will do in solving this. This solution is in fact middle school to high school level.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:IDKHowtoaddsolution&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:IDKHowtoaddsolution (page does not exist)\">IDKHowtoaddsolution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since everything is positive, the left hand side has same variations as its square\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/0/8d0e8e906acee08bfe9ab2272752e09a5cf79471.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x)= 2x+2\\sqrt{x^2-(2x-1)}=2x+2|x-1|=  \\begin{cases} 2 &amp;\\text{\\ if\\ } 1/2\\leq x\\leq 1 \\\\ 4x-2 &amp;\\text{\\ if\\ } x&gt;1 \\end{cases}\\]\" width=\"556\" height=\"53\" />\nand equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/d/6dd65a0a6580067e26b86f8dc155dc8dd1a713ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> is easy to solve&#160;: no solution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/5/1b52d7648e44923691096c546be3d585d68f2505.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/5/885caf2a2ced85bb76a3b4a1bacd31e2b4bf4e53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\in [1/2,1]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"89\" height=\"20\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> and unique solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/b/5fbb9102f43991e7d3c7128b0ac6b7124a14f691.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b+2}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"45\" height=\"39\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/4/d94ebd084e8b6801c5791566f5bb434fb1b76abc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p>So for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/0/30005c782e8d97cea573e2592d52b50f594065fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=\\sqrt2,1,2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"23\" /> we use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20e70dce11a4402d8b78222c5647af57e49cbab5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=A^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" /> to get the following solution sets&#160;:\n</p><p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/8/5581510e950d8ceb9bcbcfd0dc988d9c4538c684.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[1/2,1]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p>(b) &#216;\n</p><p>(c) {3/2}\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~aopseudo\" title=\"~aopseudo\">~aopseudo</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First determine the domain:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/4/bc487b025e74026e2c925f870d3ed0b90f3998c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x-1\\ge0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/d/eadd62e93caf32aaf40443051242677a9886294d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\ge\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Squaring,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/7/dc76323c74bc69592470fdf87d421b97c3d51b12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{x+\\sqrt{2x-1}}+\\sqrt{x-\\sqrt{2x-1}})^2=A^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"324\" height=\"34\" />.\n</p><p>Expanding,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/2/e82c5ee45470080df4a72d164951a64840c5ad49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+\\sqrt{2x-1})+(x-\\sqrt{2x-1}) +2\\sqrt{(x+\\sqrt{2x-1})(x-\\sqrt{2x-1})}=A^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -9px\" width=\"569\" height=\"35\" />,\n</p><p>so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d5e1535c29dbc1f7f2876a7484d37b7407cc40e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+2\\sqrt{x^2-(2x-1)}=A^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"221\" height=\"35\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/1/8b15f7fa64e5e9c8fdba2bcd9657ba7235a328dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+2\\sqrt{(x-1)^2}=A^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"179\" height=\"35\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/7/727344fcc8ca2b1a364d642c2ffa30cbd33da374.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+2|x-1|=A^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>[b]Case 1:[/b] <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/c/b2c3495f829e4f037d2f031a4edab72c455aefae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\le1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/b/b8b3a0dcd2067ce2e44e99cbf29427b1d0b74bc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-1|=1-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffd4ce8b7da8f0e5e254545f8cb12d3de72af0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+2(1-x)=2=A^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"187\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/c/7cc1afcf6f840f85b228d4a17718a7975639fa59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"21\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/d/eadd62e93caf32aaf40443051242677a9886294d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\ge\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, the solutions are\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e35d333a80771ace3809510f9fa634ede35eeda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\in\\left[\\frac12,1\\right]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"83\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p><p>[b]Case 2:[/b] <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66db4e19b3be56d841f02880243f258ec5d1e88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/7/b67ef9b2a5e880e669097260a34eba7887a50410.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x-1|=x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/7/537349996ea0c7a207baa18d54431079c0e46809.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+2(x-1)=A^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"21\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/c/56c6d457f8011f2ddceb971d81774505b3f47571.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x-2=A^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/7105ec4dfb39d59a29cbf70346f077378248c2b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{A^2+2}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"93\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p><p>This requires\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/9/389a1cdd8c0fb068ac5805c5fab2efab7c440834.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{A^2+2}{4}&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"41\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/f/e4fc8ad89887911c4c2d8d074c8c8d13e7ef4cf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^2&gt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Hence,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/9/b99e57aadf991656c69dc0e3768c0f7dc2b30820.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a)\\ A=\\sqrt2,\\quad \\boxed{x\\in\\left[\\frac12,1\\right]}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"211\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/c/83cb39cb11b56d5fb917d76e4677f6cb1cac103b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b)\\ A=1,\\quad \\boxed{\\text{No solution}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"196\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/4/f4417a6341b506b850f660dae34ab9aa1332bbe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(c)\\ A=2,\\quad x=\\frac32,\\quad \\boxed{x=\\frac32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"232\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~Trashboycan\" title=\"~Trashboycan\">~Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO\" title=\"1959 IMO\">1959 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1959 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1959 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1959 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1959 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1959 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1959 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1959 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?t